Data Layout & Parallel Ray Tracer

This repository is a curated portfolio edition of software originally
developed for the 2025 Computer Architecture renderer assignment at
Universidad Carlos III de Madrid.

The assignment was completed as a team project. Niko González performed the
majority of the implementation and maintains this portfolio edition. Other
team members are intentionally not named in the public-facing documentation.

This edition combines and modifies three submitted snapshots:

- first sequential delivery: 11ea54af63029b237a78e65606db9b9c437e8638
- completed sequential AoS/SoA delivery: afb938a78d0cc7612c35bacf3da36c14cd68fa47
- oneTBB parallel delivery: 6302217171cc12b790e73fb14a7b6b060668cf99

The original university repositories remain unchanged.
